{%- comment -%}
Liquid template for AI-generated email replies.

Render this server-side via POST /v2/email_templates/{id}/render before sending,
or just use it as a reference for the HTML structure. The demo sends raw
AI-generated HTML directly (see agent.html_wrap) for simplicity; this template
shows the Liquid pattern for teams that want server-side rendering with
personalization variables.

Variables:
  - customer_name: string (may be empty — Liquid handles gracefully)
  - agent_name:    string
  - reply_body:    string (plain text, will be HTML-escaped and line-broken)
{%- endcomment -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"></head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <p>Hi{% if customer_name != blank %} {{ customer_name }}{% endif %},</p>

  {{ reply_body | newline_to_br }}

  <p>Best regards,<br>
  <strong>{{ agent_name }}</strong></p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; margin: 24px 0;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">This reply was generated by an AI agent on the Telnyx platform. Sent via the Telnyx Email API.</p>
</body>
</html>
